## 7. TEST MATRIX

### Browse / search / reset (1–12 — prior gate)

1. DEFAULT hydrate = master + range 전체  
2. Pasay + 전체 = nationwide + Pasay → nearby → rest priority (every page, dup 0 / miss 0)  
3. Pasay + 10km = within → nearby → outside (전체 표시, 2026-10-27 계약)  
4. `location=all` ≠ Pasay + 전체  
5. q + Pasay + 전체 = tiers + anchor  
6. q + Pasay + 10km = 단계 안 within → nearby → outside (2026-10-27 계약)  
7. popular + q = expansion ON, popular order  
8. distance + q = expansion ON, distance order  
9. ↺ = DEFAULT, q preserved  
10. filter init = same href as ↺  
11. region+all pagination = no dup/miss (legacy disjoint)  
12. header `location=all` ≠ master LGU label  

### Pull-to-Refresh (13–20)

13. Pasay+전체 → PTR: URL unchanged, Pasay priority, fresh posts  
14. Pasay+10km → PTR: URL unchanged, 같은 구간 순서  
15. q + Pasay+전체 → PTR: q kept, search tiers kept, fresh matches  
16. q + Pasay+10km → PTR: q kept, 같은 구간 순서  
17. popular → PTR: `sort=popular` unchanged  
18. distance → PTR: `sort=distance` unchanged  
19. latest → PTR: new matching posts top per latest  
20. page2 state → PTR: old window discarded, fresh page1, duplicate 0  

