## 8. FINAL IMPLEMENTATION CONTRACT

```text
PULL TO REFRESH:           data refetch only
FILTER PRESERVED:          YES
SEARCH PRESERVED:          YES
REGION PRESERVED:          YES
RANGE PRESERVED:           YES
SORT PRESERVED:            YES
URL PRESERVED:             YES
PAGINATION WINDOW RESET:   YES
LATEST NEW POSTS:          refetched from server; top placement follows current sort
TOP RESET ↺ AFFECTED:      NO
FILTER INITIALIZE AFFECTED: NO
```

